{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Lilia nods \"it's fine. I just hope my home doesn't become a second underwater shipwreck..\" she is carrying a bag full of trinkets and keepsakes \"I hope its ok if I keep some stuff here, I don't want to lose it in case I can't go back home.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:22:45.883000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741723092845330493","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Feel free. I only have the one bedroll but, you may have it. I am used to sleeping in trees it won't bother me.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:24:03.593000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741723418784825385","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato lights a fire on his cooking stove and begins to make tea","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:24:19.863000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741723487026020405","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Thank you. After the last few days I didn't think I'd come home, when I do, everything is flooded.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:25:17.741000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741723729784209518","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"It's strange. But at least I am safe for the most part.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:25:52.038000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741723873636253787","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I wish I had my cloak for you... Wren has it still. It would help you feel warm\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:28:15.219000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741724474180894761","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Lilia waves Cato off. \"You've offered your home to me. You've done enough. A little mud and water can't keep me down forever. \"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:29:40.183000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741724830545739797","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato nods \"I am sorry for what you went through. I am sorry we didn't save you sooner.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:30:48.882000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741725118689968239","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Lilia is silent for a moment. \"I remember talking to Florian about the knights purpose for being here.. then going for a walk. Next thing I knew I was in a cage surrounded by hags.\" She pauses \"I know I haven't met many of you.. but there were others. How did you not know we were missing?\" She is calm and look genuinely curious","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:34:52.381000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741726139999060009","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"You had a doppelganger they looked like you, and sounded like you. It wasn't the same though. They weren't... sweet as you are. Filled with vile and hate. I am sorry I didn't realize. I had a rough few days.\" Cato pours her the tea as she did for them.","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:40:29.224000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741727552820740246","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I knew someone was in my house...\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:46:04.245000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741728958000791592","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I hope she didn't cause too much harm.\" She looks concerned","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:46:37.790000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741729098698850315","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato shakes his head. \"She did hate the knights though. I uh was the one to kill her\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:48:03.507000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741729458221875302","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"She nods \"Well I don't hate the knights... I was upset with them but it was a misunderstanding, lack of communication.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:49:25.740000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741729803131944972","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Your cause seems just, in my opinion.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:49:48.667000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-08T18:49:56.688000Z","id":"741729899294883972","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato nods gratefully","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:49:59.664000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741729945419513896","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I am glad you are back Lilia\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:50:22.501000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-08T18:50:27.175000Z","id":"741730041204965487","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"She smiles \"As am I.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:50:54.110000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741730173782589460","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I must confess something to you Lilia. So you know who I truly am, you weren't here when it happened.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:52:08.752000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741730486853828609","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"But I think you deserve to know.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:52:26.187000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741730559981781012","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"She looks slightly concerned but listens quietly","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:53:02.503000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741730712301863052","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I planned to abandon Roanoke and leave you all behind. After Arc died I saw a vision of my mother. I have never met her I was an orphan. I planned to return to London to find her. Everyone in town knows so you should too. I agreed to never leave though, and I will keep that promise.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:55:06.022000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741731230378229811","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Sometimes the things we seek aren't what they seem. It sounds like you might be afraid of getting close to others in fear they might leave. You retaliated and tried to leave first... but I think more than anything, you want family. I've seen how people here care about you...\"  she pauses \"We cannot go through life alone. Now more than ever, it seems there is a big fight looming in our future, it's best to fight together than alone, no?\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:59:50.211000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741732422353158227","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Together.\" Cato says the word firmly. \"You are correct. I strive for family. I had it, for an entire two days. Now my search continues. I hope Wren will understand as you do.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T19:01:33.753000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741732856639914005","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"She is still a child, but children are more perceptive than you think. I'm sure she would understand.\" She gives Cato a soft encouraging smile","created_at":"2020-08-08T19:03:03.690000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741733233863163914","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato nods. \"What have you done for fun? Other then collecting things? Draw? Write?\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T19:04:18.650000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741733548268191854","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"She sits back and thinks \"Well.. before coming to this island, I worked for a noble woman who held several Diplomatic balls and meetings... I suppose I enjoyed those. As well as some philosophy here and there.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T19:06:59.815000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741734224243195954","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I enjoy a great deal of things without really committing to a single passion I suppose.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T19:07:37.433000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741734382024523787","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
