{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"They nod slowly.","created_at":"2020-08-09T00:56:46.555000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741822249010462751","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"“The only way to stop hurting is to push through the pain.”","created_at":"2020-08-09T00:57:28.330000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741822424227643393","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"How? Do I just have to exist until I am numb to it?\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T00:57:53.915000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741822531538780261","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"“No. It’s easy to go numb. You have to fight. But you know it’s worth it. You’ve felt the happiness before. The good.”","created_at":"2020-08-09T01:03:58.966000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741824062673780816","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Fighting.... it is always fighting. That is what I have done for so long. I wish for peace. I always tell myself I am fighting *for* peace. Yet it never seems to find me.\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T01:06:25.546000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741824677474861056","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"“It is always fighting. But that’s life.”","created_at":"2020-08-09T01:14:38.163000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741826743660183563","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"A constant struggle.... Well atleast I know what I am working with. I will be fine tomorrow Wynne. Don't worry, today is just difficult.\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T01:16:01.944000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741827095063298139","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"They lean their head on Cato’s shoulder. “It gets better.”","created_at":"2020-08-09T01:19:37.007000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741827997102768171","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato nods. \"It will. I was dreading today. Hopefully I sleep tonight, excited for tomorrow. I don't have the ability to wallow anyways. Wren will need more more.\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T01:21:47.806000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-09T01:22:01.866000Z","id":"741828545713799299","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"They turn to kiss his cheek. “You’re a wonderful person. Please, don’t ever doubt that.”","created_at":"2020-08-09T01:23:25.914000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741828957208576071","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Thank you Wynne. You always support me I appreciate it. I love you.\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T01:24:04.172000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741829117674258557","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"“I love you too. You’re not alone, Cato.”","created_at":"2020-08-09T01:24:52.296000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741829319520944158","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato give a genuine smile. \"What do you think of Lady Lilia?\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T01:25:31.462000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741829483795054648","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
