{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato looks down in shame. \"I am sorry Wynne. I lacked focus. If it makes you feel better I worked very hard to keep the journal safe.\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:01:21.846000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741838503159267379","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"They smile softly. “It’s the only reason l have any idea what’s going on.”","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:02:11.707000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741838712291196978","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato nods. \"I don't know why they picked me though. Other then the emotional manipulation. It didn't make sense\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:03:04.969000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741838935688478820","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"They shrug. “We’ll never know. I just... I wish someone had noticed. That maybe ♪...or anyone else.” They look back out at the forest.","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:04:59.399000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741839415642685531","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I noticed you weren't the same, but it is quite a leap to assume someone else became you.\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:06:12.567000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741839722531258449","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"I thought you might have just been worn out like the rest of us.\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:06:32.266000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741839805155115028","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"They nod. “It’s an unfair expectation that someone would notice. I’m more upset that the hag got to make memories with you all, memories I should have made.”","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:08:15.703000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741840239001075792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"\"Think about it like this. The hag took the brunt of the terrible times we had here, so you didn't have to.\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:08:58.657000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741840419163209881","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"“But she got to lay in bed with ♪, and have his love, and got to be there for others when Baeshra died, when Arc died, and Daysong. When everything happened. I missed it all, good and bad.”","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:10:57.125000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741840916054278145","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"Cato nods. \"But we can't change the past, only the future. Try not to dwell on what you missed. Instead get excited for the memories we shall make tomorrow.\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:12:46.984000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741841376836321290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"They nod. And sigh. “You’re right. Thank you, Cato.”","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:14:44.825000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741841871097167872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055515136688148","content":"He smiles. \"We support eachother. Always.\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:15:04.826000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741841954987311136","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
